[{"id":"MzQ4-q01","number":1,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Sebanyak 1200 kg pupuk urea,&nbsp;<img alt=\"CO(NH_2)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CO%28NH_2%29\" />&nbsp;, disebar secara merata pada 10 hektar tanah ( 1 hektar = 10.000 <img alt=\"m^2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?m%5E2\" />&nbsp;), Maka jumlah dalam garam nitrogen yang ditambahkan untuk setiap&nbsp;<img alt=\"m^2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?m%5E2\" />&nbsp;adalah&nbsp;</p>","choices":["2,8 g","5,6&nbsp;g","8,4&nbsp;g","11,2&nbsp;g","14.0 g"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQyNzU"},{"id":"MzQ4-q02","number":2,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Jika 1 liter etil alkohol pada <img alt=\"20\\: ^oC\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?20%5C%3A%20%5EoC\" />&nbsp;mengandung <img alt=\"1,04 \\: X\\: 10^{25}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?1%2C04%20%5C%3A%20X%5C%3A%2010%5E%7B25%7D\" />&nbsp;molekul, maka jumlah molekul selain etil alkohol dalam 1 liter sampel etil alkohol yang kemurniannya 99,99% adalah....</p>","choices":["<img alt=\"2,72\\: X\\: 10^{20}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2%2C72%5C%3A%20X%5C%3A%2010%5E%7B20%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"1,04\\: X\\: 10^{21}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?1%2C04%5C%3A%20X%5C%3A%2010%5E%7B21%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"3,15\\: X\\: 10^{22}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?3%2C15%5C%3A%20X%5C%3A%2010%5E%7B22%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"3,13\\: X\\: 10^{23}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?3%2C13%5C%3A%20X%5C%3A%2010%5E%7B23%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"2,14\\: X\\: 10^{24}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2%2C14%5C%3A%20X%5C%3A%2010%5E%7B24%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQyNzY"},{"id":"MzQ4-q03","number":3,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Cuplikan suatu senyawa diketahui mempunyai rumus empiris&nbsp;<img alt=\"XBr_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?XBr_2\" />. Sebanyak 0,5000 gram cuplikan tersebut dilarutkan ke dalam air. ke dalam larutan tersebut kemudian ditambahkan larutan perak nitrat berlebih setelah di keringkan, endapan AgBr yang diperoleh mempunyai massa 1,0198 gram. Massa atom relatif unsur X adalah&nbsp;</p>","choices":["208.51","137.33","67,72","&nbsp;47,88","24,25"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQyNzc"},{"id":"MzQ4-q04","number":4,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Rumus kimia suatu garam adalah <img alt=\"XCI_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?XCI_2\" />.Ion X dalam garam ini mempunyai 28 elektron. Logam X adalah</p>","choices":["Ni","Co","Fe","Cu","Zn"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQyNzg"},{"id":"MzQ4-q05","number":5,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Pada suhu kamar dan tekanan atmosfer, 1 garam oksigen mengisi ruang dengan volume 0,764 liter, sedangkan 1 gram oksida nitrogen dalam kondisi yang sama mengisi ruang dengan volume 0,266 liter. Berdasarkan data tersebut, maka rumus oksida nitrogen termksud adalah....</p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"NO_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NO_2\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"NO_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NO_3\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"NO_5\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NO_5\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"N_2O_4\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?N_2O_4\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"N_2O_5\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?N_2O_5\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQyNzk"},{"id":"MzQ4-q06","number":6,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Pada 400 K dan tekanan 1 atm 40% dinitrogen tetraoksida,&nbsp;<img alt=\"N_2O_4\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?N_2O_4\" />, terurai sesuai dengan persamaan reaksi :</p><p><img alt=\"N_2O_4(g)\\leftrightharpoons \\: 2\\: NO_2(g)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?N_2O_4%28g%29%5Cleftrightharpoons%20%5C%3A%202%5C%3A%20NO_2%28g%29\" /></p><p>teknan parsial <img alt=\"N_2O_4(g)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?N_2O_4%28g%29\" />&nbsp;adalah</p>","choices":["0,3956 atm","0,4286 atm","0,4615&nbsp;atm","0,5385&nbsp;atm","0,5714&nbsp;atm"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQyODA"},{"id":"MzQ4-q07","number":7,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Orbital hidrida yang di gunakan pada permbentukan ikatan&nbsp;<img alt=\"XeF_4\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?XeF_4\" />, yang geometri senyawanya berbentuk bujur sangkar adalah</p>","choices":["<img alt=\"sp^2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?sp%5E2\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"sp\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?sp\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"sp^3d\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?sp%5E3d\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"d^2sp^3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?d%5E2sp%5E3\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"sp^3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?sp%5E3\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQyODE"},{"id":"MzQ4-q08","number":8,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara pasangan senyawa berikut yang memiliki kemiripan geometri molekul adalah</p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"CO_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CO_2\" />&nbsp;dan&nbsp;<img alt=\"OF_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?OF_2\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"CO_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CO_2\" /> dan&nbsp;<img alt=\"BeCI_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?BeCI_2\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"SO_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?SO_2\" /> dan&nbsp;<img alt=\"BF_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?BF_3\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"PH_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?PH_3\" />&nbsp;dan&nbsp;<img alt=\"BF_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?BF_3\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"H_2O\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?H_2O\" />&nbsp;dan&nbsp;<img alt=\"CO_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CO_2\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQyODI"},{"id":"MzQ4-q09","number":9,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Diketahui<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20211222161739.PNG\" style=\"height:149px; width:470px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQyODM"},{"id":"MzQ4-q10","number":10,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20211222161900.PNG\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQyODQ"},{"id":"MzQ4-q11","number":11,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20211222162027.PNG\" style=\"height:121px; width:446px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQyODU"},{"id":"MzQ4-q12","number":12,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Sejak tahun 1850, sebagian besar buku dicetak pada kertas asam, sehinga kertas menjadi mudah rapuh dan hancur . Untuk melindunginya dari kerapuhan, sebelum di gunakan, kertas direalisasikan dengan uap dietizink,&nbsp;<img alt=\"Zn(C_2H_5)_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Zn%28C_2H_5%29_2\" />, yang keduanya bereaksi dengan residu asam dan juga dengan sedikit air yang tertahan di kertas ini reaksi dietizink dengan suatu asam menghasilkan etana,&nbsp;<img alt=\"C_2H_6\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?C_2H_6\" />&nbsp;adalah sebagai berikut :</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20211226145543.PNG\" style=\"height:149px; width:450px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQyOTg"},{"id":"MzQ4-q13","number":13,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara garam berikut yang mempunyai kelarutan molar paling kecil dalam air pada&nbsp;<img alt=\"25^oC\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?25%5EoC\" />&nbsp;adalh</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20211226145825.PNG\" style=\"height:105px; width:241px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQyOTk"},{"id":"MzQ4-q14","number":14,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Ke dalam larutan yang mengandung ion&nbsp;<img alt=\"Ag^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Ag%5E&amp;plus;\" />&nbsp;atau&nbsp;<img alt=\"Au^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Au%5E&amp;plus;\" />, yang masing masing konsentrasinya 0,0010 M ditambahkan sedik demi sedikit padatan NaCI hingga endapan yang kedua mulai berbentuk. Konsentrasi Ion&nbsp;<img alt=\"Au^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Au%5E&amp;plus;\" />&nbsp;pada kondisi tersebut adalah ( Diketahui Nilai&nbsp;<img alt=\"K_{sp} = AgCI = 1,8 \\: \\: X10^{10}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?K_%7Bsp%7D%20%3D%20AgCI%20%3D%201%2C8%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20X10%5E%7B10%7D\" />&nbsp;dan&nbsp;<img alt=\"K_{sp} = AuCI = 2,0 \\: \\: X10^{-13}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?K_%7Bsp%7D%20%3D%20AuCI%20%3D%202%2C0%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20X10%5E%7B-13%7D\" /></p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20211226150445.PNG\" style=\"height:106px; width:141px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQzMDA"},{"id":"MzQ4-q15","number":15,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Anda membuat 1 L larutan yang mengandung <img alt=\"\\tiny 0,010\\: M\\: Mg(NO_3)_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%200%2C010%5C%3A%20M%5C%3A%20Mg%28NO_3%29_2\" />&nbsp; dan <img alt=\"\\tiny 0,20 M NH_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%200%2C20%20M%20NH_3\" />.<br /> Besarnya konsentrasi <img alt=\"\\tiny NH_4CI\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%20NH_4CI\" /> (dalam mol/L) yang dibutuhkan untuk mencegah terjadinya&nbsp;<br /> pengendapan <img alt=\"\\tiny Mg(OH)_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%20Mg%28OH%29_2\" />&nbsp; pada <img alt=\"\\tiny 25^oC\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%2025%5EoC\" /> adalah ( diketahui : Nilai <img alt=\"\\tiny K_b\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%20K_b\" /> larutan&nbsp;<br /><img alt=\"\\tiny NH_3 = 1,8X 10^{-5} dan K_{sp} Mg(OH)_2 = 1,5 X 10^{-11}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%20NH_3%20%3D%201%2C8X%2010%5E%7B-5%7D%20dan%20K_%7Bsp%7D%20Mg%28OH%29_2%20%3D%201%2C5%20X%2010%5E%7B-11%7D\" />.","choices":["0,054","0,560","0,092","0,860"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQzMDM"},{"id":"MzQ4-q16","number":16,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Elektrolisis larutan NaCI dalam air dengan menggunakan elektroda inert, di salah satu elektroda menghasilkan gas klor<br /> pada elektroda lain dihasilkan gas hidrogen, Sehingga larutan di sekitar elektroda besifat basa. Persamaan setengah reaksi<br /> katoda dalam sel elekrolis tersebut adalah....</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20220105161808.PNG\" style=\"height:110px; width:211px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQzMDQ"},{"id":"MzQ4-q17","number":17,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Hukum laju untuk reaksi : <img alt=\"\\tiny 2C_4H_12 \\: adalah\\: r=k[C_4H_6]. Jika [C_4H_6]=2,0 M\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%202C_4H_12%20%5C%3A%20adalah%5C%3A%20r%3Dk%5BC_4H_6%5D.%20Jika%20%5BC_4H_6%5D%3D2%2C0%20M\" />, laju reaksinya adalah<br /> 0,106 M/detik. Jika <img alt=\"\\tiny [C_4H_6]=4,0 M\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%20%5BC_4H_6%5D%3D4%2C0%20M\" />, maka laju reaksinya adalah</p>","choices":["0,022 M/detik","0,053 M/detik","0,106 M/detik","0,212 M/detik","0,424 M/detik<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQzMDU"},{"id":"MzQ4-q18","number":18,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara proses berikut,<br /> 1) perubahan air menjadi es<br /> 2) pemanasan gas pada volume tetap<br /> 3) Pembukaran hidrokarbon<br /> 4) Pembentukan ikatan H-H dari dua atom hidrogen</p><p>Kenaikan entropi terjadi pada proses","choices":["1 dan 2","1 dan 3","1 dan 4","2 dan 3","2 dan 4"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQzMDY"},{"id":"MzQ4-q19","number":19,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Hubungan antara kedua senyawa di bawah ini adalah&nbsp;</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20220105161925.PNG\" style=\"height:130px; width:294px\" />","choices":["Enantiomer","Diastereomer","Isomer Geometri","Isomer Struktur&nbsp;","Senyawa yang sama namun berbeda konformasi"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQzMDc"},{"id":"MzQ4-q20","number":20,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Produk utama dari reaksi berikut adalah</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20220105161953.PNG\" style=\"height:361px; width:497px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQzMDg"},{"id":"MzQ4-q21","number":21,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20220105162015.PNG\" style=\"height:244px; width:475px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQzMDk"},{"id":"MzQ4-q22","number":22,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Senyawa 1-bromopropana dibuat dengan cara memanaskan propan -1-ol bersama KBr dan&nbsp;<br /><img alt=\"\\tiny H_2SO_4\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%20H_2SO_4\" /> paket. Setelah didistilasi, 1-bromopropana masih bercampur dengan <img alt=\"\\tiny S0_2, HBr, Br_2, CH_3CH_2OH\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%20S0_2%2C%20HBr%2C%20Br_2%2C%20CH_3CH_2OH\" />&nbsp;dan <img alt=\"\\tiny C_3H_7OC_3H_7\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%20C_3H_7OC_3H_7\" />&nbsp;.&nbsp;<br /> Distilatnya kemudian ditambahkan natrium karbonat, lalu dikocok untuk menghilangkan pengotor-pengotornya. Pengotor yang tidak dapat dihilangkan<br /> dengan proses tersebut adalah","choices":["<img alt=\"\\tiny S0_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%20S0_2\" />","<img alt=\"\\tiny HBr\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%20HBr\" />","<img alt=\"\\tiny Br_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%20Br_2\" />","<img alt=\"\\tiny CH_3CH_2CH_2OH\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%20CH_3CH_2CH_2OH\" />","<img alt=\"\\tiny C_3H_7OC_3H_7\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%20C_3H_7OC_3H_7\" /><br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQzMTA"},{"id":"MzQ4-q23","number":23,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20220105162201.PNG\" style=\"height:392px; width:545px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQzMTE"},{"id":"MzQ4-q24","number":24,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara reaksi substitusi di bawah ini yang berlangsung melalui mekanisme reaksi radikal bebas adalah:</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20220105162243.PNG\" style=\"height:460px; width:369px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQzMTI"},{"id":"MzQ4-q25","number":25,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara rekasi-reaksi berikut yang pereaksi anorganiknya berperan sebagai nukleofil adalah<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20220105162305.PNG\" style=\"height:169px; width:413px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQzMTM"},{"id":"MzQ4-q26","number":26,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20220105162321.PNG\" style=\"height:240px; width:265px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQzMTQ"},{"id":"MzQ4-q27","number":27,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Nitrobenzena dapat dibuat melalui campuran benzea dengan asam nitrat dan asam&nbsp;<br /> sulfat paket sesuai skema reaksi berikut&nbsp;</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20220106080430.PNG\" style=\"height:54px; width:436px\" /></p><p>fungsi dari asam sulfat dalam reaksi di atas adalah","choices":["Menetralkan larutan benzena&nbsp;","Membentuk komplek yang tidak stabil dengan benzena","Memprotonisasi asam nitrat","Sebagai pelarut","Mencegah asam nitrat mengoksidasi benzena."],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQzMTU"},{"id":"MzQ4-q28","number":28,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Suatu senyawa hidrokarbon yang berwujud cair pada suhu kamar, dapat<br /> menghilangkan warna larutan brom. Senyawa tersebut adalah....","choices":["<img alt=\"\\tiny C_2H_6\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%20C_2H_6\" />","<img alt=\"\\tiny C_2H_4\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%20C_2H_4\" />","<img alt=\"\\tiny C_10H_20\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%20C_10H_20\" />","<img alt=\"\\tiny C_12H_26\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%20C_12H_26\" /><br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQzMTY"},{"id":"MzQ4-q29","number":29,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>&nbsp;</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20220106080626.PNG\" style=\"height:379px; width:500px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQzMTc"},{"id":"MzQ4-q30","number":30,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Poliklorinasi bifenil (PCB) digunakan sebagai pelastis dan isolator listrik namun&nbsp;<br /> sekarang menjadi bahan berbahaya terhadap lingkungan.salah satu senyawa PCB adalah sebagai berikut.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20220106080723.PNG\" style=\"height:110px; width:190px\" /></p><p>Campuran suspensi PCB dan natrium hidroksida diaduk. Jumlah atom klor pada PCB yang dapat dihidrolisis dengan NaOH adalah","choices":["0","1","2","3","5"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQzMTg"}]
